    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/76c2018af3e4c9830033d987fc90d589.avif?t=1750874831\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Doomies (Damikira)</i> is a frenetic arcade shooter filled with guns, violence, dark humor, and even a grappling hook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/90b387228beee4c4f1cb06fe2baa8695.poster.avif?t=1750874831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/90b387228beee4c4f1cb06fe2baa8695.webm?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/90b387228beee4c4f1cb06fe2baa8695.mp4?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s built to help you waste time (in the best way possible) and throw you into a flow state where your only goal is to obliterate freaky enemies and climb the online leaderboard, proving just how much you enjoy staying indoors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It might look simple, but this beast hides layers of chaos under the hood. Beneath the blood and bullets lie secrets, tricks, and twisted mechanics for those brave (or bored) enough to dig deep. Got nothing better to do? Doomies does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/c45407e17a699ee00cb677036219b4bf.avif?t=1750874831\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Unlock a wild arsenal of guns</strong> \u2014 each louder, nastier, and deadlier than the last</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/18171a2771ec2bcc38d8112e46e77f3c.poster.avif?t=1750874831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/18171a2771ec2bcc38d8112e46e77f3c.webm?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/18171a2771ec2bcc38d8112e46e77f3c.mp4?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude08 <strong>Play as a cast of deranged freaks</strong> \u2014 each with unique animations and bad attitudes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Fully voiced characters</strong> \u2014 because grunting isn\u2019t enough to express this chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Online leaderboards</strong> \u2014 dominate the global rankings or die trying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>A freak-ton of blood</strong> \u2014 paint the screen red, every time, all the time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Loud, punchy gunfire</strong> \u2014 every shot hits like a drum solo to the face</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Fast, satisfying gameplay</strong> \u2014 designed to keep you locked in and fired up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Face-melting metal soundtrack</strong> \u2014 riffs harder than your uncle\u2019s garage band ever could</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Slightly randomized levels</strong> \u2014 no two runs are the same\u2026 or safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/f183ae6bdddcf42bda0855c94edc239b.poster.avif?t=1750874831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/f183ae6bdddcf42bda0855c94edc239b.webm?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/f183ae6bdddcf42bda0855c94edc239b.mp4?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd18 <strong>And a hell of a lot of fun, goddammit</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/76c2018af3e4c9830033d987fc90d589.avif?t=1750874831\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Doomies (Damikira)</i> is a frenetic arcade shooter filled with guns, violence, dark humor, and even a grappling hook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/90b387228beee4c4f1cb06fe2baa8695.poster.avif?t=1750874831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/90b387228beee4c4f1cb06fe2baa8695.webm?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/90b387228beee4c4f1cb06fe2baa8695.mp4?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s built to help you waste time (in the best way possible) and throw you into a flow state where your only goal is to obliterate freaky enemies and climb the online leaderboard, proving just how much you enjoy staying indoors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It might look simple, but this beast hides layers of chaos under the hood. Beneath the blood and bullets lie secrets, tricks, and twisted mechanics for those brave (or bored) enough to dig deep. Got nothing better to do? Doomies does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/c45407e17a699ee00cb677036219b4bf.avif?t=1750874831\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Unlock a wild arsenal of guns</strong> \u2014 each louder, nastier, and deadlier than the last</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/18171a2771ec2bcc38d8112e46e77f3c.poster.avif?t=1750874831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/18171a2771ec2bcc38d8112e46e77f3c.webm?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/18171a2771ec2bcc38d8112e46e77f3c.mp4?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude08 <strong>Play as a cast of deranged freaks</strong> \u2014 each with unique animations and bad attitudes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f <strong>Fully voiced characters</strong> \u2014 because grunting isn\u2019t enough to express this chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Online leaderboards</strong> \u2014 dominate the global rankings or die trying</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>A freak-ton of blood</strong> \u2014 paint the screen red, every time, all the time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Loud, punchy gunfire</strong> \u2014 every shot hits like a drum solo to the face</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Fast, satisfying gameplay</strong> \u2014 designed to keep you locked in and fired up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Face-melting metal soundtrack</strong> \u2014 riffs harder than your uncle\u2019s garage band ever could</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Slightly randomized levels</strong> \u2014 no two runs are the same\u2026 or safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/f183ae6bdddcf42bda0855c94edc239b.poster.avif?t=1750874831\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/f183ae6bdddcf42bda0855c94edc239b.webm?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446700/extras/f183ae6bdddcf42bda0855c94edc239b.mp4?t=1750874831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd18 <strong>And a hell of a lot of fun, goddammit</strong></p>",
